|                             |                       |         |
| network.tx                  |  tx_bytes             |  Metric |
|                             |                       |         |
| network.rx                  |  rx_bytes             |  Metric |
|                             |                       |         |
| memory.total_rss            |  total_rss            |  Metric |
|                             |                       |         |
| memory.total_cache          |  total_cache          |  Metric |
|                             |                       |         |
