It looks like you are using rspm as a local CRAN proxy.
Unfortunately, I don't think that plays nicely with rsconnect (and packrat) when capturing the R package dependencies before deploying. I will start a discussion with the relevant folks, but in the meantime, you will need to disable rspm and reinstall the packages in order to be able to deploy to shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>

